  "releaseNotes": "0.1.6 adds incremental PostgreSQL schema migrations with\n      deterministic model snapshots and diffs, generated Up/Down migration source,\n      SQL scripts, database update and baseline commands, history tracking,\n      transactional application with advisory locking, and NativeAOT-safe static\n      migration registration. Existing EnsureCreated databases can be validated\n      and baselined. See RELEASE_NOTES.md for details.",
